recommendations.detail:
Give the sentry:
- an additive searchlight cone along the floor that matches SIGHT_RANGE and turns red when it locks on;
- a taller mast or sensor head so it towers over the engineer;
- a lens glow that lights the wall;
- a servo that is audible through the sealed door before the blast, plus its shadow passing the door seam (heard before seen).
The cone also makes the stealth rules readable.
